# HS Fall Retreat

**Registration link**: TBD

## Mark Your Calendars

**October 9-11, 2026**

HS Fall Retreat is Camp Otyokwah's fall retreat for students in grades 9th-12th. It is a time to step away from your busy, distracted life and take a breath. We invite students to come for a spiritual retreat — to renew their relationship with God in a personal and powerful way.

In just one weekend we will challenge campers with God's word, share the love of Jesus Christ, and worship together. All the while we will be having fun building relationships, playing games, and eating great food.

Whether you are a returning camper or joining us for the first time, HS Fall Retreat is a great opportunity to grow in your faith and make lasting friendships!

## The Cost

The registration cost of HS Fall Retreat is **$125** for registrations before the early-bird deadline.

**Early-bird deadline**: TBD

